Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||10-18-1999||08:00 PM||||I used to be on V8-Archie's list, and when he first did the chop-top mod on a Fiero,  <IMG SRC="http://www.v8archie.com/warber22.jpg">  as seen in the background of this photo (the blue one), he said he is 6'4" and he fits in it ok.. I'm not so sure about that.. I'm 6'2", and I find Fieros a bit small.. Now unless there's no seats in that car, and the driver sits on the floor....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>regarding the appearance, I do prefer the fastback look. but I like the IRM(?) side panels, I've seen those on a few Fieros. anyone know how much they cost?||||reg||1
